      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/censo/reg/memberOfGroup",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Membership in a collectively assessed set. Group membership is curated knowledge with provenance, not a spreadsheet column."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The group standards this analyte counts towards. Emitted by\nevery package that declares a group threshold, because a sum standard whose\nmembership is not stated cannot be assessed: the question \"was all of it\nmeasured\" has no answer, and the answer is what decides between an aggregate\nverdict and censo:IndeterminateCompliance.\n\nThis replaces cereg:groupCoverage, which was declared as the FRACTION of a\ngroup actually measured, domained on a reified assessment, ranged xsd:double --\nand emitted by the package builder as the integer COUNT of declared members, on\nthe group. Three mismatches in one triple. The count it really carried is\nderivable from these memberships with COUNT, so the property is gone rather\nthan renamed, and the coverage the manuscript reports is an analysis result\nthat belongs in the analysis and not in the regulation package."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/censo/Analyte"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "member of group"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/censo/reg/SubstanceGroup"
      }
    ]
  },
